@baseUrl = https://smartcart-api.test/api/v1
@deviceCode = CART-07
@qrCode = SC-DEMO-0001
@email = admin@smartcart.test
@adminPassword = <SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD_LOCAL>
@accessToken = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### Iniciar como invitado
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_code": "{{deviceCode}}"
}

### Iniciar con QR demo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_code": "{{qrCode}}",
  "device_code": "{{deviceCode}}"
}

### Login admin
# Sustituye <SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD_LOCAL> por el valor local de SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Datos del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Renovar token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cerrar sesión e invalidar token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Debe responder 401 después del logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Validación: dispositivo inexistente (debe responder 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_code": "CART-99"
}
